flowchart LR
  UI[React SOC Dashboard] --> GW[NGINX API Gateway]
  GW --> ING[Log Ingestion]
  GW --> DET[Threat Detection]
  GW --> TI[Threat Intelligence]
  GW --> INC[Incident Management]
  ING --> DB1[(ingestion_db)]
  DET --> DB2[(detection_db)]
  TI --> DB3[(intelligence_db)]
  INC --> DB4[(incident_db)]
  ING -- LogReceived / async --> MQ[(RabbitMQ)]
  MQ -- log.received --> DET
  DET -- REST / sync + breaker --> TI
  DET -- ThreatDetected / async --> MQ
  MQ -- threat.detected --> INC
